# LockPlus
pass quick on lo0 all
pass out quick on utun4 proto {tcp, udp} to 10.0.0.1 port 53 flags any
pass out quick on utun6 proto {tcp, udp} to 10.0.0.1 port 53 flags any
pass out quick on utun4 proto {tcp, udp} to fd00::1 port 53 flags any
pass out quick on utun6 proto {tcp, udp} to fd00::1 port 53 flags any
block drop out quick proto {tcp, udp} to any port 53
